## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: br-x20cp1586
name: "B&R X20CP1586 — X20 PLC CPU, Intel Atom E680T 1.6GHz, 512MB DDR2, POWERLINK V1/V2, 1x IF slot"
manufacturer: "B&R Industrial Automation"
mcu: "Intel Atom E680T (x86, 1.6GHz, 512KB L2, FPU) + integrated I/O processor"
category: plc
image: br-x20cp1586.svg
url: "https://www.br-automation.com/en/products/plc-systems/x20-system/x20-plc/x20cp1586/"

## 2. TECH SPECS & DIMENSIONS:
specs:
